{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/107","repository_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms","labels_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/107/labels{/name}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/107/comments","events_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/107/events","html_url":"https://github.com/illusion-tech/poms/issues/107","id":6190136983,"node_id":"I_kwDORtdXRM8AAAABcPX-lw","number":107,"title":"[RUST-R4D] 移交七入口与受控变更真实闭环","user":{"login":"wangzishi","id":8288105,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjgyODgxMDU=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/8288105?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi","html_url":"https://github.com/wangzishi","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wangzishi/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"labels":[],"state":"open","locked":false,"assignees":[],"milestone":null,"comments":0,"created_at":"2026-11-03T19:58:32Z","updated_at":"2026-11-03T20:08:10Z","closed_at":null,"assignee":null,"author_association":"MEMBER","issue_field_values":[],"type":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"parent_issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/106","issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"状态：G0 / 输入审计，G1待冻结。\n\n父#106（上级#101，总体#57）。\n\n5入口：合同承接摘要、项目最新/指定移交详情、确认、再基线化；补齐真实移交准备/参与人确认/摘要与回款判断冻结，验收R2附件真实消费。复核与R5角色冻结边界，不能将回款判断冻结当提成冻结或制造循环依赖。\n\n基线main 565661b9113372de4da6662a4a692fbfd2296dd6，分支 codex/poms-r4def-next28。用户授权本批G0→联合G1→三线实现→实际验收→独立G3/fixed/main/G4，仅收本批；#101/#57保持Open。\n\n业务语义、正确性、合理性优先，不追求Node缺陷级对齐。必要业务/版本/快照/审计/会话写入借同一外层事务整体提交或回滚。公共契约、路由、DDL/迁移入口、生成物、Git/GitHub和真实运行环境由Root单一写入。三作者分别独占D/E/F模块；G2使用隔离工作树、端口/数据/构建输出，G1独立审查与线上冻结前禁止产品编码。子代理显式gpt-6.1-sol/max，Fast未核实。\n\nR3和R4首批37已G4；新批不重复计其交付。经营核算17、验收完工归档8及R5仅冻结依赖和必要边界，不在本批实现。必要内部机制按本批真实消费归属纳入，不虚构公开路由、不以prepared-state/测试seed冒充真实生产者。PG17/旧private/历史证据保留；无部署、切流或性能结论。\n\n- [x] G0：原生父子Issue及范围\n- [ ] 联合G1：30入口候选canonical/DTO/DDL/内部producer/事务/版本/金额精度/审批归属冻结\n- [ ] 三线实现及独占文件交付\n- [ ] 统一候选真实上游消费、HTTP/PG/权限/故障/并发/原UI验收及精确清理\n- [ ] 非作者G3、固定提交与main集成\n- [ ] 生命周期归档、独立G4及线上实际读回\n\n\n2026-11-04 用户业务裁决与范围修订：\n\n用户已明确裁决：补齐必要公共入口和最小操作界面，重核本批范围；允许同人多职责，各登录参与人只确认本人职责，正式execution仍需R5有效角色冻结；费用/入账两位，费率四位/工时两位，人工精确HALF_UP至分，分摊确定性尾差且守恒，完整份额整批原子替代，历史多位金额不自动改写。\n\n当前候选D7/E11/F12共30，其中28既有+2新route（准备移交、本人职责确认）。受控合同变更复用既有准备→精确审核→激活链，新行为单列受审，不重复计已交付HTTP。canonical候选已登记，精确DTO/DDL/真实机制及独立G1待冻结，尚未准入G2。基线 docs/design/rust-r4def-next30-baseline.md；用户原文 docs/design/rust-r4def/user-decisions01.json。经营17与验收完工归档8仍后续，本批不关闭#101/#57。\n","closed_by":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/107/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"timeline_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/illusion-tech/poms/issues/107/timeline","performed_via_github_app":null,"state_reason":null,"pinned_comment":null}